We have;

\begin{aligned}
5^{124} &=\left(5^{3}\right)^{41} \cdot 5 \\
\text { Now, } 5^{3} &=1 \cdot(\bmod 124) \\
\left(5^{3}\right)^{41} &=1\langle\bmod 124) \\
\left(5^{3}\right)^{41} \cdot 5 &=1 \times 5(\bmod 124)=5(\bmod 124)
\end{aligned}

So, the remainder obtained when $5^{124}$ is divided by 124 is 5 .

